<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed, ref } from 'vue'
import { growthRecords } from '../lib/growth-records'
import UiIcon from './UiIcon.vue'
const axis=ref('source')
const groups=computed(()=>{const keyOf=(r:typeof growthRecords.value[number])=>axis.value==='time'?(r.at?.slice(0,10)??'尚未发生'):axis.value==='topic'?r.topic:axis.value==='method'?r.method:r.source;return [...new Set(growthRecords.value.map(keyOf))].map(title=>({title,items:growthRecords.value.filter(r=>keyOf(r)===title)}))})
</script><template><section class="c2-profile-stats" aria-label="成长记录概览"><article class="c2-profile-stat"><strong>{{ growthRecords.filter(r=>r.done).length }}</strong><small>/ {{ growthRecords.length }} 条</small><h2>已经留下的记录</h2><p>取自本次操作和演示行为日志</p></article><article class="c2-profile-stat"><strong>{{ growthRecords.filter(r=>!r.done).length }}</strong><small>条</small><h2>还缺一个具体动作</h2><p>没有记录的保持未完成，不用打开次数代替</p></article></section><section class="ws-paper c2-growth-pool"><div class="ws-section-head"><div><h2>这 {{ growthRecords.length }} 条，换个角度看</h2><p>同一批记录按来源、时间、主题或怎样确认重组。完成条件与原始记录始终保留。</p></div></div><div class="c2-lensbar" role="group" aria-label="成长记录的组织方式"><button v-for="o in [{key:'source',label:'按来源'},{key:'time',label:'按时间'},{key:'topic',label:'按主题'},{key:'method',label:'按怎么确认的'}]" :key="o.key" :aria-pressed="axis===o.key" @click="axis=o.key">{{ o.label }}</button></div><section v-for="group in groups" :key="group.title" class="c2-note-group"><h3>{{ group.title }}<span>{{ group.items.length }} 条</span></h3><article v-for="r in group.items" :key="r.id" class="c2-growth-record" :data-record-id="r.id"><header><UiIcon :name="r.done?'check':'review'" :size="20"/><h3>{{ r.title }}</h3><span>{{ r.done?'已发生':'还没有可确认的记录' }}</span></header><p>{{ r.source }} · {{ r.at ? new Date(r.at).toLocaleDateString('zh-CN') : '时间未提供' }}</p><ul><li v-for="line in r.evidence" :key="line">{{ line }}</li></ul><small>确认方式：{{ r.method }} · {{ r.next }}</small></article></section></section><p class="ws-demo-note">行为与核验均为演示记录，不提供手动解锁；正式记录由真实服务确认。</p></template>